  "details": "Upon opening VRChat and trying to load into my home world, the thumbnail displays No Image. If I try opening a world I've recently visited, it loads without issues. If I try opening a world I have never visited before, I immediately get kicked back into my home world. \n\nIf I try loading an avatar I HAVE used before, it loads without issue. If I try loading an avatar I have not used before, I see the default Robot, this includes Fallback avatars.\n\nI tried clearing the cache which made the default VRChat home world load, and none of my avatars visible, including ones I have made myself; only loading the Robot. \n\nVerifying the game files via steam did not work either.",
